# The Wi-Fi's saved networks in ネットワーク設定 on the x64 PC (docs/tessronos/09-network.md
# 9.6.6, 9.6.7), for tools/x64/ui_run64.py with the image of make TARGET=_X64_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1
# sdimg (WIFI=1 is the x64 build's own). QEMU's machine has no Wi-Fi card: the UI test's wifitest
# gives the Wi-Fi manager a card for the tests. The places, the waits and what is seen are those
# of tools/tests/ui_wifikey.steps.
wifitest
expect wifi: test card ready
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 800
click 437 163
expect netenv: scan 4 networks, 4 shown
wait 2000
shot wk_list
# TessronOS-Test, the first row: its SSID and WPA2 into the parts
click 505 321
wait 2000
click 463 432
wait 1000
text secret-pass1
wait 2000
click 385 466
expect wifi: saved a network, a new key: 0
expect netenv: wifi changed
wait 2000
shot wk_saved
# another network of the scan (not saved: an empty password), then the one saved again:
# eight marks for its password
click 505 338
wait 2000
shot wk_other
# 保存した接続 opened: its list stays open while the program reads the card every second
# (three seconds: three readings), and the saved network is chosen in it with ↓ and Enter a
# tenth of a second apart, as quickly as a person types them
click 463 256
wait 3000
shot wk_popup
key 51
wait 100
key 28
expect netenv: saved network chosen
wait 2000
shot wk_masked
click 481 466
expect netenv: wifi joined as saved
expect wifi: test: joining "TessronOS-Test", with the saved key
wait 2000
# forgotten, with no question
click 669 256
expect wifi: forgot a network: 0
wait 2000
shot wk_forgot
# WPA3-Personal: Office-WPA3-Only typed in ＳＳＩＤ (at 463,289; the scan's list shows three rows
# of its four), WPA3-Personal chosen in the pop-up of セキュリティ (at 463,394) with ↓ and Enter
# (its four choices open: shot wk_secpop), a password typed and saved: the kernel keeps the
# password for SAE (shot wk_wpa3), and 接続 with the marks left joins by SAE with it
click 463 289
wait 1000
text Office-WPA3-Only
wait 1000
click 463 394
wait 1500
shot wk_secpop
key 51
wait 100
key 28
wait 1500
click 463 432
wait 1000
text wpa3-secret-9
wait 1500
shot wk_wpa3
click 385 466
expect wifi: saved a network, a new key: 0 (wpa3)
expect netenv: wifi changed
wait 2000
click 481 466
expect netenv: wifi joined as saved
expect wifi: test: joining "Office-WPA3-Only", by SAE with the saved password
wait 2000
# WPA2/WPA3-Personal, the next choice of the pop-up, a password typed over the marks and saved:
# both the PMK and the password kept
click 463 394
wait 1500
key 51
wait 100
key 28
wait 1500
click 463 432
wait 1000
text wpa3-secret-9
wait 1500
click 385 466
expect wifi: changed a network, a new key: 0 (wpa2wpa3)
wait 2000
shot wk_wpa2wpa3
click 481 466
expect wifi: test: joining "Office-WPA3-Only", with the saved key, by SAE with the saved password
wait 2000
click 669 256
expect wifi: forgot a network: 0
wait 2000
# 表示の倍率 150%
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen scale 100%, 3 scales
wait 500
click 658 455
wait 300
click 658 495
wait 300
click 706 554
expect wm: drawn at 150% (was 100%)
wait 1500
key 28
expect drawn at 150%, kept
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 1500
click 437 163
wait 2500
shot wk_list150
absent !OACV!
